Now I'm going to go over and I'm going to show you how we can edit our

5
00:00:29.899 --> 00:00:35.740
our volumes to change it to make it sort of fit our gameplay.

6
00:00:36.539 --> 00:00:44.539
So the first thing that I'm going to drag in is something that's called a nav mesh modifier.

7
00:00:44.539 --> 00:00:53.020
So if I jump into here type in nav you'll see that we have the nav mesh modifier volume.

8
00:00:53.020 --> 00:01:00.299
This is another volume that's going to allow us to change an area.

9
