So you're going to see that our character just cannot walk through this area.

16
00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:52.239
Yeah, that's pretty straightforward.

17
00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:59.629
Now I'm going to be typing in show navigation a lot.

18
00:01:59.629 --> 00:02:05.390
So what I'm going to do is I'm just going to jump into our open level blueprint.

19
00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:10.620
